CHARACTER CREATION

The creation process includes:

  1. Name
  2. Race
  3. Class
  4. Appearance (or randomize)
  5. Body build
  6. Stat generation (roll or point-buy)
  7. Racial minimums and modifiers
  8. Class modifiers
  9. Build modifiers
 10. PvP mode (peaceful or deadly)
 11. Preview
 12. Confirmation

You may reroll stats, change race/class/build, or preview again.
